  "prompt": "For each activation event name, how many users have it as their latest activation event? event_ts holds UTC instants. Each activated user counts once, under the event_name of their latest event. When two events of a user tie on event_ts, the one whose event_name comes first alphabetically is kept. Return two columns, in this order: event_name and users. Return one row for each event_name that is some user's latest. Any row order is fine.",
